<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Sticker Ideas</p>

      <h1>Cute Sticker Ideas for AI Stickers</h1>

      <p>
        Use these cute sticker ideas as prompt starters for animals, food, cozy objects, tiny
        mascots, expressive characters, and playful everyday items.
      </p>

      <.link class="saas-button saas-button-primary" navigate={~p"/search"}>
        Search Sticker Ideas
      </.link>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Cute animal stickers</h2>

        <p>
          Try prompts like sleepy kitten with moon pillow, happy corgi in rain boots, or tiny panda
          holding a cookie.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Food and object stickers</h2>

        <p>
          Turn simple objects into characters: smiling coffee cup, cozy soup bowl, cheerful flower,
          or strawberry with tiny sunglasses.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Mascot sticker prompts</h2>

        <p>
          For brands or projects, describe a friendly mascot, its emotion, colors, and use case,
          then regenerate variations from the best result.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Cute sticker idea categories</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Animals: sleepy kitten, tiny panda, happy corgi, shy bunny, proud penguin.</li>

        <li>Food: smiling strawberry, cozy soup bowl, cheerful coffee cup, dancing cookie.</li>

        <li>Objects: happy flower, tiny backpack, moon pillow, sparkly notebook, cute lamp.</li>

        <li>
          Reactions: excited mascot, sleepy face, thumbs up, surprised expression, thank you sticker.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Cute sticker prompt examples</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>sleepy kitten hugging a moon pillow, cute sticker, soft colors, white border</code>
        <code>smiling strawberry wearing tiny sunglasses, kawaii sticker, simple background</code>
        <code>happy coffee cup mascot waving, clean sticker icon, rounded shape</code>
        <code>tiny panda eating a cookie, cute reaction sticker, crisp outline</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Build a cute sticker set</h2>

      <p>
        To create a consistent sticker set, repeat the same subject family, border style, color
        direction, and mood words. Add one idea per line to run a small batch, then download the
        completed set as a ZIP from history.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/kawaii-sticker-maker"}>Kawaii Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/custom-sticker-maker"}>Custom Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/search"}>Search Sticker Ideas</.link>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="saas-faq">
      <details open>
        <summary>What are easy cute sticker ideas?</summary>

        <p>
          Try a sleepy animal, smiling snack, tiny household object, cozy weather icon, or simple
          mascot with one clear emotion. Short cute sticker prompts usually produce cleaner results.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How do I turn ideas into a sticker set?</summary>

        <p>
          Write one idea per line and keep the style consistent. You can download the finished
          batch as a ZIP and retry failed prompts from your history.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I search for AI sticker inspiration?</summary>

        <p>
          Use the sticker search page to browse generated examples and reuse promising concepts as
          prompts for new stickers or variations.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
